<title>ITALY: Italian Nov industrial output down 5.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Italian Nov industrial output down 5.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Statistics Institute ISTAT gave the following provisional figures for industrial production, year-on-year, in November.</p>
<p> INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION		Nov 96   Oct 96   Nov 95</p>
<p> Production index (unadjusted)     108.7    118.2(r) 115.5</p>
<p> Yr/yr pct change (unadjusted)	-5.9     +0.3(r)  +3.4</p>
<p> Mnth/mnth pct change (adjusted)    +0.8     -0.7(r)   0.0</p>
<p> Working days in month		    20	 23	 21</p>
<p>Note: (The industrial production index was rebased in January 1994 on 1990 levels, replacing a 1985-based index.)</p>
</text>
